{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_032emi0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_032emi0064_1000_032emi", "source_sha256": "b961495aa00e2cc029ec00150bb36734d23c47ea51bca321a97287353a22f7a4", "ja": "はぁ……。\nこのお衣装、なんど見ても、すごく素敵です……。", "zh": "呼……\n这套服装，不管看几次都好漂亮……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_032emi0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_032emi0064_1001_p", "source_sha256": "a88de230773da7037f38f8ae3a5715f5591ada39ecac140fbf3fc7e00b6f999c", "ja": "（いつもはおしとやかで控えめなエミリーも、\nやっぱり13歳の女の子……。邪魔しちゃ悪いかな）", "zh": "（艾蜜莉平时虽然端庄稳重，\n但果然还是13岁的女孩……不要打扰她好了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_032emi0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_032emi0064_1002_032emi", "source_sha256": "cac83b2695ba3a9d78e216f93293673ee0f1f8d48c132f23ca433f8cd3c55929", "ja": "Wow！　仕掛け人さま！　いらっしゃったのですか？\nあの……どうですか？　私、おかしくないですか？", "zh": "Wow！策划执行人先生！原来您在这里吗？\n请问……您觉得如何呢？我看起来会不会很奇怪？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_032emi0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_032emi0064_1003_p", "source_sha256": "d508a58bf9bb7a126d9c35e97214b0b8d2db260b103c30c4f7075cf1dcbd21cb", "ja": "ああ、エミリーの綺麗な髪によく映えてるよ。\n和風テイストを取り入れてみたのは正解だったな。", "zh": "不会啊，艾蜜莉，这套服装能衬托出你的秀发。\n看来采用和风设计是正确的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_032emi0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_032emi0064_1004_032emi", "source_sha256": "b37def1312569ec49d377f5e0ef1170e12a920feea5f2ab0ab1b55860e1d7b9b", "ja": "えへへ……ありがとうございます♪\nこんなにも綺麗な衣装……私、本当にうれしくて。", "zh": "嘿嘿……谢谢您的夸奖♪\n能穿到这么美丽的服装……我真的好开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_032emi0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_032emi0064_1005_032emi", "source_sha256": "2a71b26369277e62ab71dda49d5a377b8e64b008a63581fc1f98e144905ba1a0", "ja": "今までに見たどんな晴れ着よりも、\nずっと素敵に見えて、本当に……夢みたいな気分です♪", "zh": "这比我以往看过的任何盛装都还要美丽，\n真的……就像是作梦一样♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_032emi0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_032emi0064_1006_p", "source_sha256": "4a1baef21186499418498b4b57208b17745c0f2d2dce02105d557179d98ee110", "ja": "気にいってくれたみたいでよかった。衣装もそうだけど\n今のエミリーの笑顔には、ファン達も喜ぶだろうな。", "zh": "看来你很喜欢，真是太好了。如果粉丝们看到新服装，\n还有艾蜜莉现在脸上的笑容，一定也会很开心吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_032emi0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_032emi0064_1007_032emi", "source_sha256": "e52d90d18a36cdb89514ce910dadf8d17fc0cbdf0cb51ba0e03e821dd68c7064", "ja": "はい、私もたくさんのごヒイキ様方に、\n早くこの衣装を見ていただきたいと思います！", "zh": "是呀，我也想赶快\n让许多主顾欣赏这套服装！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_032emi0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_032emi0064_1008_p", "source_sha256": "1cdd67314e85d0d9047ec71ef1bc8670bd7c7dc44d1243af4b3b94955b8f32fc", "ja": "ああ、エミリーにぴったりな仕事やステージを、\nたくさん用意するつもりだ。一緒にがんばろうな！", "zh": "好，我也会替艾蜜莉\n准备许多合适的工作和舞台。一起加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_032emi0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_032emi0064_1009_032emi", "source_sha256": "ad869d42a1a817899bb1eef2933b2646782e06d9de54ecd42f711dfc9e26bd46", "ja": "はい！　誠心誠意、頑張りますね♪", "zh": "好的！我会诚心诚意地努力的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_032emi0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_032emi0064_1010_032emi", "source_sha256": "edd0949fa76ba5720bf3a6d6278c8e95174a534d62da39380084034f7903422b", "ja": "あ、でも……。\nじつは少しだけ、困っていることがあって……。", "zh": "啊，可是……\n其实有件事情让我有点困扰……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_032emi0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_032emi0064_1011_p", "source_sha256": "3790a87e938288f29df6d0edf03c682fffd9ed944b818f4cf49005fd84ce7092", "ja": "エミリー？", "zh": "艾蜜莉？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_032emi0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_032emi0064_1012_032emi", "source_sha256": "31ad7e158c7e964069314cc66331851d1ec40c66a642ed95fb62adf8c88575f0", "ja": "こんなによくしていただいて……、私、仕掛け人さまに\nどうお礼をしたらいいんでしょうか……。", "zh": "策划执行人先生待我这么好……\n我该怎么向您致谢呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_032emi0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_032emi0064_1013_032emi", "source_sha256": "d4d86a97cb69e6a472f87837113bfaf2f7cf4d4a4698fab9968f24264b9f2418", "ja": "あ、とっておきの抹茶巻菓子が、\nたしか、おうちにまだ……。", "zh": "啊，我珍藏的抹茶卷点心，\n家里应该还有剩……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_032emi0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_032emi0064_1014_p", "source_sha256": "bcace3c6f6e9bf21cd066f01b1f692031177cabbb723ccaaa84f71af3dfc827a", "ja": "いやエミリー、そういうのは……。", "zh": "不用了，艾蜜莉，不需要谢礼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_032emi0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_032emi0064_1015_032emi", "source_sha256": "389303beb4a8c1676db365900571123de17915da44538a01c9e0a704e1bc711b", "ja": "でも、いくらおいしくても、仕掛け人さまのご恩には、\nとても釣り合わない気がします。", "zh": "可是，再怎么美味的东西，\n我觉得都无法报答策划执行人先生的恩情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_032emi0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_032emi0064_1016_032emi", "source_sha256": "8c4ed09f5fdb7724e74820dc5a8f2e129d675752cc7372078d80b254a08b9d16", "ja": "はぅ……いったい、どうしたら……。", "zh": "啊呜……到底该如何是好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_032emi0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_032emi0064_1017_p", "source_sha256": "bf8c7829f2af8ced0b86d1a35fd2574351213e0cb0e8364987693836bf3a871c", "ja": "はは、エミリー、お礼なんていいんだよ。\nもう、充分もらったから。", "zh": "哈哈，艾蜜莉，不用准备谢礼啦。\n我已经收到了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_032emi0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_032emi0064_1018_032emi", "source_sha256": "a8b020096d202411ba914b10e0bddaf1b226291240bf77cb80a086d81bf6da57", "ja": "えっ？　でも、私はまだ何も……。", "zh": "咦？可是，我什么都还没……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_032emi0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_032emi0064_1019_p", "source_sha256": "e333a81a3282939a10326c674ed7a00d8d04758e35d429b7287e5895b8ebc743", "ja": "たくさん喜んでくれただろ？\nそのこと自体が、俺には何よりの贈り物なんだ。", "zh": "但你不是很开心吗？\n这件事情本身对我来说就是最棒的礼物了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_032emi0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_032emi0064_1020_032emi", "source_sha256": "802f6ba1c6afef528483fc53f5c672253dcd175dc0ca45581de5cf039ddfd0f7", "ja": "仕掛け人さま……。", "zh": "策划执行人先生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_032emi0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_032emi0064_1021_p", "source_sha256": "617c797308b7191934fab48c35f7a4176529bbaa4f1793070ce59c1a662db842", "ja": "喜んでくれてありがとう、エミリー。\nこれからも、一緒にがんばろうな！", "zh": "谢谢你这么开心，艾蜜莉。\n以后也继续一起加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_032emi0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_032emi0064_1022_032emi", "source_sha256": "a73566b38a15d4f0518b6e5470e5cbddac8c620ad01798cc3d4b96aec932c551", "ja": "はい……。わかりました、仕掛け人さま！\nでもやはり、このままではよくない気がします……。", "zh": "好的……我知道了，策划执行人先生！\n不过，我还是觉得应该向你道谢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_032emi0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_032emi0064_1023_032emi", "source_sha256": "289136d7f5fc8b44da2bac18fa2ade09c55bbf844421ca21364141531cac741e", "ja": "ですから、この衣装を着た私にたくさんお仕事をさせて\nくださいね。私、歌に舞踊に、精一杯がんばって……", "zh": "所以，请给穿上这套服装的我更多工作吧。\n我会努力唱歌、跳舞……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_032emi0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_032emi0064_1024_032emi", "source_sha256": "cc82430474a9fac90c8927b883546b0471dce736ae062836715e79051c23a6a4", "ja": "いつかきっと、仕掛け人さまのご期待に応えられる、\n立派な大和撫子になってみせます♪", "zh": "总有一天，我一定会成为优秀的大和抚子，\n不辜负策划执行人先生的期待♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
